message.content:
{
 "action": "deliver_reel",
 "words": "Rita, take this. It’s the last one. Don’t worry about the line closing; I’ll handle the crew until you’re back.",
 "intention": "Ensure the recording of Alma reaches the station patch immediately so it can be processed or broadcast before the end of the shift, while reassuring Rita that I will manage the immediate logistics so she can focus on the tape.",
 "detail": "I hold out the small reel canister with a steady hand, making sure the label facing her reads 'Alma - Final Take'. I step back slightly to give her space to plug it in, watching the patch lights flicker as she connects it. I do not stay to watch the screen; I turn my attention back to the lobby door, checking that the other crew members are seated and ready, just as Rita instructed."
}
